<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the Gezira Open squash championship on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Danny Meddings (England) beat Jason Nicolle (England) 11-15 15-12 15-9 13-15 15-7</p>
<p>Mark Cairns (England) beat Zarak Jahan (Pakistan) 15-9 15-11 13-15 15-11</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Simon Frenz (Germany) 17-15 7-15 15-6 17-14</p>
<p>Alex Gough (Wales) beat 4-Simon Parke (England) 13-15 15-7 15-12 8-15 15-13</p>
<p>Julian Wellings (England) beat Stephen Meads (England) 12-15 15-13 15-10 15-14</p>
<p>Dan Jenson (Australia) beat Craig Wapnick (U.S.) 10-15 15-8 15-8 15-13</p>
<p>Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Lucas Buit (Netherlands) 15-12 11-15 15-9 15-11  </p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Juha Raumolin (Finland) 15-10</p>
<p>15-11 15-5</p>
<p>Amir Wagih (Egypt) beat Derek Ryan (Ireland) 8-15 17-15 15-9</p>
<p>17-15</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat 8-Anthony Hill (Australia) 15-6 9-15</p>
<p>15-8 15-10</p>
<p>5-Del Harris (England) beat Julien Bonetat (France) 15-10 15-13</p>
<p>15-13</p>
<p>Zubair Jahan (Pakistan) beat Ahmed Faizy (Egypt) 15-7 12-15</p>
<p>11-15 15-12 15-3</p>
<p>7-Mark Chaloner (England) beat Mir Zaman Gul (Pakistan) 12-15</p>
<p>15-11 15-13 17-14</p>
<p>6-Chris Walker (England) beat Paul Johnson (England) 15-8 15-7</p>
<p>11-15 15-9</p>
<p>Omar el Borozossy (Egypt) beat Martin Heath (Scotland) 17-16</p>
<p>10-15 15-5 15-5</p>
<p>Jonathan Power (Canada) beat Emad Kuratum (Egypt) 15-8 15-3</p>
<p>15-6</p>
